 communicative topics for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Describes common health conditions by the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Describes common health conditions by the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Describes common health conditions by the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Describes common health conditions by the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le11ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Health"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Making an Appointment</span><br> When you are feeling sick, you may need to see a doctor. To see a doctor, you need to make an appointment. You have to call the  clinic and make an appointment with the receptionist. When you make an appointment, you need to arrange the date and time.<br><br><span class=\"strong\">Symptoms</span><br>When you see a doctor, he or she might ask, \u201c What are your symptoms?\u201d.<br> Symptoms are feelings of illness or discomfort.<br></br><span class=\"strong\">Diagnosis</span><br>  A diagnosis is when a doctor tells you the medical name of your problem.<br><br><span class=\"strong\"> Explaining a problem</span><br>You can use certain sentences to describe your health problems.  You can use the Present Continuous tense or the Simple Present tense to explain yourself."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I am not feeling well. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have a cough."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have a bad back."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have a sore throat. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have a fever."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mobility"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "ability to move quickly and easily "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to improve my mobility."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in a doctor's office."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "acupuncture "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a way of relieving pain or curing illness by placing needles into a person's skin "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I had acupuncture on Saturday and I feel much better."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fish oil "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a liquid substance that comes from  fish  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Some say that fish oil can help your joints."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "needle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a very thin, pointy steel tube that is pushed through the skin  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Acupuncture uses lots of little needles."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "upset "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "sore, unhappy "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa has an upset stomach."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "food poisoning"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be ill from eating unsafe food "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa might have food poisoning."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modals for Advice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A doctor may give you advice about what to do about your health problems. <br/>They can use <span class=\"strong\"> modals </span> like <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\"> should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">can</span> to give advice. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You can try some fish oil."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should eat more fruit and vegetables. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You could read this pamphlet. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Research a health issue in your community."}, {"type": "text", "content": ") Write a pamphlet with the headings: <span class=\"italic\">Title</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Definition</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Symptoms</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Exams</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Tests</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Treatment</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your pamphlet with a partner or family member."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify health conditions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a health pamphlet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my pamphlet with a partner or family member."}]}], "type": "sena"}